The numbers is a list of 1, 2, 2, and 1.
The left is 0.
The right is the last position of numbers.
The answer is 1.
Repeat while left is less than right.
If item left of numbers is not item right of numbers, set answer to 0.
Add 1 to left.
Set right to right minus 1.

If answer is 1, show true, otherwise show false.
